  "operative_text": "Section 1 (Md. Code Ann., Public Safety § 5–306(e)): (E) IF AN APPLICANT IS AN ACTIVE, RESERVE, OR RETIRED MEMBER OF THE ARMED FORCES OF THE UNITED STATES OR THE NATIONAL GUARD, THE APPLICANT IS PRESUMED TO HAVE A GOOD AND SUBSTANTIAL REASON TO WEAR, CARRY, OR TRANSPORT A HANDGUN."
